<title>USA: Ingersoll-Rand names O'Brien as CFO.</title>
<headline>Ingersoll-Rand names O'Brien as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>WOODCLIFF LAKE, N.J. 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ingersoll-Rand Co said Monday it has named Frank O'Brien senior vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>O'Brien, said the company, previously served as chief financial officer and senior vice-president/corporate development at NACCO Industries Inc.</p>
<p>The company said its previous CFO left in October.  </p>
<p>The company said that its previous CFO retired.</p>
</text>
